You summon a corpselight that radiates cold for 7 turns in radius 3.

Every turn all foes inside take [36, 48, 57, 65, 73 (TL1-5; SP 100)] cold damage.

Anytime you cast a spell while standing inside your corpselight's area it grows by one stack, each stack giving +1 radius and +10% damage.

The corpselight can gain at most [3, 4, 5, 6, 7 (TL1-5)] stacks and the radius will never extend beyond 10.

If cast while under 1 life it spawns with 3 stacks.

The damage will increase with your Spellpower.
